{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Hear</b> — This prophet prophesied concerning the locust that would come to destroy the land. In the days of Moses there was one species of locust alone, but now with the locust there are also gazam, yelek, and chasil, and these are three species that are forbidden [as food]. And he said to the elders, 'Has such as this ever been?'"], :book :joel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Joel -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/yoel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:06:20.548673297Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}